ymbol","title":"ServerTrustPolicyManager","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ServerTrustPolicyManager","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ServerTrustPolicyManager","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Responsible for managing the mapping of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerTrustPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" objects to a given host."}],"url":"\/documentation\/sunday\/servertrustpolicymanager","type":"topic"},"doc://Sunday/documentation/Sunday":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sunday\/documentation\/Sunday","role":"collection","title":"Sunday","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/sunday","type":"topic"},"doc://Sunday/documentation/Sunday/ServerTrustPolicy":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sunday\/documentation\/Sunday\/ServerTrustPolicy","url":"\/documentation\/sunday\/servertrustpolicy","role":"symbol","title":"ServerTrustPolicy","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ServerTrustPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServerTrustPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" evaluates the server trust generally provided by an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSURLAuthenticationChallenge"},{"type":"text","text":" when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connecting to a server over a secure HTTPS connection. The policy configuration then evaluates the server trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a given set of criteria to determine whether the server trust is valid and the connection should be made."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ServerTrustPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}